                                                "sense_id": "e6be03f6-42b8-3f9f-9401-8ebdf4aaf52f",
                                                "text": "“Business is not booming anymore,” said Scot Barton, who in mid-2008 revamped his home-sitting business into a company that rehabs foreclosures for banks and real-estate agents."
                                            },
                                            {
                                                "example_id": "781e3a9d-6481-4a82-8093-1e2452cc995c",
                                                "sense_id": "e6be03f6-42b8-3f9f-9401-8ebdf4aaf52f",
                                                "text": "I saw an article in the Woman's Weekly about home-sitting, and I thought, 'I could do that.' […] Since I'm retired, home-sitting brings me a bit of extra money - like jam on your bread. And you save on the electricity bill."
                                            },
                                            {
                                                "example_id": "d9b37f74-5620-40c3-b012-014389fafcb4",
                                                "sense_id": "e6be03f6-42b8-3f9f-9401-8ebdf4aaf52f",
                                                "text": "For some animals, such as those who are easily stressed, home-sitting might be best, said Richard Goldstein, chief medical officer at the Animal Medical Center in Manhattan."
